==Strategy==
Shouldn't be that hard to defeat the Hermit Pengs and Mighty Gui Zuli, meatshields can easily hold them off while [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] as well as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] slowly chip away at them.

